{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790382631230,"sessionID":"ses_f24e3b5c3ffeWovQc3Ur0AnXn9","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_YQJH9RqVfhigrapPsLb27Wk2","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/task_config.json"},"output":"<path>/workspace/task_config.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"instruction\": \"Implement scenes/draggable.tscn as a decoration component that can be dragged. The root Area2D must be named Draggable in the scene, set collision_mask to 2, linear_damp to 20, and attach scripts/draggable.gd. Under it, add Sprite2D named Sprite that uses assets/sprites/star_1.png and is uniformly scaled to 0.58, plus a CollisionShape2D named CollisionShape that holds a 72\\u00d772 RectangleShape2D covering the sprite. Implement scripts/draggable.gd so it records initial_position and initial_scale on _ready(), shrinks to zero and tweens back in play_spawn_animation(), listens for the \\\"click\\\" action in _on_input_event/_input, lerps toward the mouse while dragging, emits dropped(self, overlapping_areas) on release, and calls self_destruct() with a shrink tween whenever it is dropped outside DropTarget's region.\"\n3: }\n\n(End of file - total 3 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement scenes/draggable.tscn as a decoration component that can be dragged. The root Area2D must be named Draggable in the scene, set collision_mask to 2, linear_damp to 20, and attach scripts/draggable.gd. Under it, add Sprite2D named Sprite that uses assets/sprites/star_1.png and is uniformly scaled to 0.58, plus a CollisionShape2D named CollisionShape that holds a 72\\u00d772 RectangleShape2D covering the sprite. Implement scripts/draggable.gd so it records initial_position and initial_scale on _ready(), shrinks to zero and tweens back in play_spawn_animation(), listens for the \\\"click\\\" action in _on_input_event/_input, lerps toward the mouse while dragging, emits dropped(self, overlapping_areas) on release, and calls self_destruct() with a shrink tween whenever it is dropped outside DropTarget's region.\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/task_config.json","text":"{\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement scenes/draggable.tscn as a decoration component that can be dragged. The root Area2D must be named Draggable in the scene, set collision_mask to 2, linear_damp to 20, and attach scripts/draggable.gd. Under it, add Sprite2D named Sprite that uses assets/sprites/star_1.png and is uniformly scaled to 0.58, plus a CollisionShape2D named CollisionShape that holds a 72\\u00d772 RectangleShape2D covering the sprite. Implement scripts/draggable.gd so it records initial_position and initial_scale on _ready(), shrinks to zero and tweens back in play_spawn_animation(), listens for the \\\"click\\\" action in _on_input_event/_input, lerps toward the mouse while dragging, emits dropped(self, overlapping_areas) on release, and calls self_destruct() with a shrink tween whenever it is dropped outside DropTarget's region.\"\n}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":3,"totalLines":3,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/task_config.json","time":{"start":1790382631152,"end":1790382631173}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_002aebe5160c7b56016ab71226ca848196b3a17ea8189ccab8"}},"id":"prt_0db1ee8ed001ARBZxg1eO5vUNs","sessionID":"ses_f24e3b5c3ffeWovQc3Ur0AnXn9","messageID":"msg_0db1ed326001IIudkRV22vOOWH"}}
